Description: Software Manager for Debian and Debian Menta
 A software store to easily find, install and remove applications:
  * browse Debian packages and Flatpaks by category, with featured
    and top rated applications
  * shows screenshots, descriptions, ratings and reviews
  * installs and removes Debian packages through PackageKit
  * installs Flatpaks and their add-ons, and shows whether their
    developer was verified by Flathub
  * installs local .deb files with their dependencies, like GDebi
  * finds applications for file types that have none, when asked by
    the file manager (PackageKit session interface)
  * reads and writes reviews on the Open Desktop Ratings Service
 .
 Forked from the Linux Mint Software Manager (mintinstall).
